/E (Previous large-scale work by Tong et al. systematically evaluated 278 RNA-seq pipelines and showed that pipeline components such as mapping, quantification and normalization jointly affect accuracy, precision and reliability of gene expression, and that these differences carry through to disease-outcome prediction. In this project, my intentions were to implement a smaller-scale comparison focused on differential expression methods and normalization to see how analysis choices change the set of genes considered significant and the biological conclusions drawn.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [4]
>>
